Subject: [EXPERIMENT] ASoC: wsa884x: separate opt-in VI and CPS SoundWire streams

Adapt the reference Golden v32 codec routing from
geocausa/SP11X1e-audio@3232e1dacdeb580a10a9cb8d4756a4518a7bd83e.
Preserve default single-DAI playback, and do not set amplifier gain. The new
DP5/DP6 routes require explicit board opt-in and the SoundWire SIMPLE patch.

diff --git a/sound/soc/codecs/wsa884x.c b/sound/soc/codecs/wsa884x.c
index f58ce92..6b93ba2 100755
--- a/sound/soc/codecs/wsa884x.c
